OL,3,GNEWSA'Danger of collapse' as fire
OL,4,Aengulfs former hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to avoid part of
OL,7,FMarch while firefighters battle a blaze
OL,8,Fat a former hotel.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to the former Station Hotel
OL,12,Fat about 12:45 GMT on Monday.
OL,14,FAbout 20 firefighters were sent to the
OL,15,Fscene on Station Road.
OL,17,FPolice told the BBC the building was
OL,18,F"in danger of collapse".
